  [>] Missed: Titanite Scale from the Cemetery Crystal Lizard
      A Crystal Lizard on a side path in the Cemetery of Ash drops a Titanite Scale (used to upgrade boss-soul and special weapons). You left the area without it. How to get back: Warp back to the Cemetery of Ash bonfire at any time - the lizard respawns when you rest. It is on the small side path to the left before Iudex Gundyr's arena.
  [>] Talk to Emma - required to progress
      Emma, the High Priestess, sits at the top of the High Wall cathedral. She gives you the Small Lothric Banner - required to leave the High Wall - and the Way of Blue covenant ring.
  [i] Missed: Covetous Silver Serpent Ring in the Firelink rafters
      The Covetous Silver Serpent Ring (+10% souls from kills) is hidden behind an illusory wall in the rafters above Firelink Shrine. Worth picking up early - it pays for itself fast. How to get back: Two routes: the free one is a run-and-jump from the roof onto the tree branch and through the upper window (roof access via the Tower Key path or the tree-jump trick); otherwise buy the Tower Key (20,000 souls) from the Shrine Handmaid and cross the bridge to the roof.
